## CSS Animation Library

```css
@keyframes pulse-glow { 0%,100% { opacity:1 } 50% { opacity:0.65 } }
@keyframes slide-up   { from { opacity:0; transform:translateY(14px) } to { opacity:1; transform:translateY(0) } }
@keyframes fade-in    { from { opacity:0 } to { opacity:1 } }
@keyframes aurora     { 0%,100% { transform:translate(0,0) scale(1) } 50% { transform:translate(20px,-12px) scale(1.06) } }
@keyframes neon-pulse { 0%,100% { box-shadow:0 0 8px var(--accent) } 50% { box-shadow:0 0 22px var(--accent) } }
```

